1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We're team MARS//404.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
We got lost on a mountain with no signal.
On Mars, when do you turn back?

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
MARS//404 — know when to turn back.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Real NASA data: HiRISE terrain, THEMIS heat, slope.

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,500
Targets at real Curiosity outcrops.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Route on foot. Return in 28 minutes.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Oxygen drops? It finds a closer target.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
No GPS: beacons guide the way back.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
For the first crews walking on Mars…

10
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
…and for hikers and rescuers on Earth with no signal.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Next: rover routes and satellite coverage.
